+# Mirror of the LIVE /etc/systemd/system/tuner.service (sha256 8d475345…bada4 on 2026-10-21 11:24 +02:00).
+# The crates/tuner build (integration-4 42de672, sha256 89c7fcbc…2b12) was deployed IN PLACE to
+# /opt/galion/tuner/bin/tuner by galion-deploy on 2026-10-21 04:32 +02:00; the unit file did not change.
+# The old staged copy pointed at /opt/galion/openmind/dist/bin-ws/tuner, which does not exist on the VPS.
